@guide H_25_Desolace
@name Desolace (32-34)
@faction Horde
@levels 32-34
@zone Desolace
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Desolace, visit 1 of 2 on the Horde route, levels 32-34.
@next H_26_StranglethornVale

travel Desolace
train
note From Freewind Post fly to the Crossroads and ride west through Stonetalon Mountains (or fly to Sun Rock Retreat if you have it) and take the road south into Desolace. Ghost Walker Post is in the middle of the zone.
accept 1365 Khan Dez'hepah | Felgur Twocuts, Ghost Walker Post.
turnin 1362 The Kolkar of Desolace
accept 1367 Magram Alliance
accept 1368 Gelkis Alliance
complete 1367 Magram Alliance
complete 1368 Gelkis Alliance
accept 1434 Befouled by Satyr | Takata Steelblade.
accept 5561 Kodo Roundup | Smeed Scrabblescrew at the caravan camp just east of Ghost Walker Post.
note The next quest, Bodyguard for Hire, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 5821 Bodyguard for Hire
complete 5821 Bodyguard for Hire | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin 5821 Bodyguard for Hire
turnin 1367 Magram Alliance
complete 5561 Kodo Roundup | Use the Kodo Kombobulator on Ancient, Aged or Dying Kodos in the Kodo Graveyard (south of Ghost Walker Post) and lead them back to Smeed.
turnin 5561 Kodo Roundup
complete 1365 Khan Dez'hepah | Khan Dez'hepah in the Kolkar village, east.
turnin 1365 Khan Dez'hepah | Ghost Walker Post.
accept 1366 Centaur Bounty | Felgur Twocuts. Needs Khan Dez'hepah turned in.
complete 1366 Centaur Bounty | Centaur Ears from the Kolkar back in the eastern village.
complete 1434 Befouled by Satyr | Hatefury satyrs at Sargeron, north of the Kolkar village.
turnin 1366 Centaur Bounty | Ghost Walker Post.
turnin 1434 Befouled by Satyr
note Ride south-west to Shadowprey Village on the coast.
fp Shadowprey Village
accept 6143 Other Fish to Fry | Drulzegar Skraghook, Shadowprey Village.
accept 5763 Hunting in Stranglethorn
accept 6142 Clam Bait
turnin 1368 Gelkis Alliance
accept 5741 Sceptre of Light | Azore Aldamort, the tower on the north-west coast.
accept 6161 Claim Rackmore's Treasure! | Rackmore's Log by the Karnitol wreck, just south of Azore's tower.
complete 6142 Clam Bait
complete 6143 Other Fish to Fry | Slitherblade naga along the north-west coast.
complete 6161 Claim Rackmore's Treasure! | Silver Key from Drysnap Crawlers on the shore, Golden Key from Slitherblade Naga.
turnin 6161 Claim Rackmore's Treasure! | Rackmore's Chest on Ranazjar Isle, north-west. Swim across.
complete 5741 Sceptre of Light | The Sceptre drops from the Burning Blade Seer at the top of the Thunder Axe Fortress tower.
turnin 5741 Sceptre of Light | Azore Aldamort.
turnin 6143 Other Fish to Fry | Shadowprey Village.
turnin 6142 Clam Bait
level 34 | Stranglethorn Vale starts at 34. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
